If you are not disintegration resistant (and have no reflection)
1. your shield (if any) gets destroyed, and you survive
2. your cloak and suit (if any) gets destroyed, and you survive
3. after the rest gets destroyed (to cover edge cases), you die

See also the comment in the mid of the above source code.

